  data: {
    LLM: "Play begins with player to dealer's right and proceeds counterclockwise. On turn, play exactly one card from hand. If its rank matches the top of any table pile (central play pile or any capture pile), take that top card plus any immediately underlying equal-rank cards and place them on top of your capture pile. If no match exists, place played card on top of central play pile. After all players exhaust current 4-card hands, dealer gives another 4 to each if stock remains. Continue until stock and hands are empty.",
    Player: "Play begins with player to dealer's right and proceeds counterclockwise. On turn, play exactly one card from hand. If its rank matches the top of any table pile (central play pile or any capture pile), take that top card plus any immediately underlying equal-rank cards and place them on top of your capture pile. If no match exists, place played card on top of central play pile. After all players exhaust current 4-card hands, dealer gives another 4 to each if stock remains. Continue until stock and hands are empty.",
    objective: 'Capture high-value cards and reach agreed cumulative target score before opponents.',
    gameplay: "Play begins with player to dealer's right and proceeds counterclockwise. On turn, play exactly one card from hand. If its rank matches the top of any table pile (central play pile or any capture pile), take that top card plus any immediately underlying equal-rank cards and place them on top of your capture pile. If no match exists, place played card on top of central play pile. After all players exhaust current 4-card hands, dealer gives another 4 to each if stock remains. Continue until stock and hands are empty.",
    keyRules: [
      'Only top cards of piles are visible and inspectable; hidden underlying cards are unknown until uncovered.',
      'Suits are irrelevant; rank only matters for matching.',
      'A player may effectively steal from their own capture pile by matching its top rank.',
      'Uncaptured cards left in play pile at end score for nobody.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
